  sentences:
  - name: Girlfriend
    text: "\u2026Clean? Not put some stupid graffiti on here?..."
  - name: Girlfriend
    text: "I did hear his mother say there\u2019s someone who does that here. Fine.
      Yes. You can clean it."
  - name: Girlfriend
    text: "Please just\u2026 be careful. This is the only place where no one gets
      to argue about who he was."
